{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>[And she shall go up.</b> In the context of judgment, the term עליה (going up) is apt]." "<b>And his yevama shall go up to the gate.</b> The yevama goes after the yavam." "<b>To the gate.</b> It is a requirement for the court that it be at the height of the city, and that it be among the elders." "<b>To establish for his brother a name in Israel.</b> And not among converts. From here they said: two brothers who are converts, whose conception was not in sanctity and whose birth was in sanctity, are exempt from חליצה and from yibum."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:12.020179087Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}